  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Statistics Coop Western Balkans 2013-2016 - Reg statistics coop W Balkans 2012-2015</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Regionalt statistiksamarbete V:a Balkan 2013-2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional statistical cooperation on the Western Balkans between the   National Statistical Institutes in the region and SCB for the period  2013 - 2016. The cooperation is built on SCB together with a Regional Statistics Committee (RSC) is planning the competence development     that should be carried out. SCB is providing the main part of the     expertis, follow up of the plans is done in the RSC.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Regionalt statistiksamarbete p&#xe5; V&#xe4;stra Balkan mellan                  statistikbyr&#xe5;erna i regionen och SCB f&#xf6;r perioden 2013 - 2016.        Samarbetet bygger p&#xe5; att SCB tillsammans med en regional              statistikkommitte planerar vilken kompetensutveckling som ska         genomf&#xf6;ras. SCB st&#xe5;r f&#xf6;r huvuddelen av expertkunskapen, uppf&#xf6;ljning   av planerna sker i den regionala kommitten.</narrative>
  </description>
